        "ggS6jQYCKit_text": "<span style=\"color:#000000;\"><strong>How To Stop Crusty Eyes In 30 Seconds A Day</strong></span><span style=\"color:#47B5E9;\"><strong> — Without Baby Wipes, Grooming, Or Home Remedies</strong></span>",
